#: data/org.gnome.Usage.desktop.in.in:2
#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:17 data/ui/window.ui:18
#: data/ui/window.ui:33
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilisation"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.desktop.in.in:3
msgid ""
"A nice way to view information about use of system resources, like memory "
"and disk space"
msgstr ""
"Un bon moyen d’afficher les informations sur l’utilisation des ressources "
"système, telles que la mémoire et l’espace disque"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/org.gnome.Usage.desktop.in.in:12
msgid "Monitor;System;Process;CPU;Memory;Network;History;Usage;Performance;Task;Manager;"
msgstr "surveiller;système;processus;traitement;processeur;mémoire;réseau;historique;utilisation;performance;tâche;gestionnaire;"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:18
#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:20
msgid "Usage developers"
msgstr "Développeurs d’Utilisation"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:22
msgid "Analyse your system"
msgstr "Analysez votre système"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:24
msgid ""
"Usage helps with simple to understand ways to analyze how the system uses "
"its resources."
msgstr ""
"Cette application aide à comprendre et à analyser de façon simple la manière "
"dont le système utilise ses ressources."

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:29
msgid ""
"Easy access to which app uses what amount of processing power or memory, "
"helps find performance issues."
msgstr ""
"Un accès facile à quelle application utilise quelle quantité de puissance de "
"traitement ou de mémoire, aidant à trouver les problèmes de performance."

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:33
msgid ""
"The storage view provides insight to simplify cleaning up unnecessary "
"leftover files."
msgstr ""
"La vue stockage fournit des informations pour simplifier le nettoyage des "
"fichiers inutiles restants."

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:42
msgid "See where the processing power is going"
msgstr "Voir où va la puissance de traitement"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:46
msgid "Understand which application is using up the memory"
msgstr "Comprendre quelle application utilise la mémoire"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.metainfo.xml.in.in:50
msgid "Find what fills the storage"
msgstr "Trouver ce qui remplit le stockage"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.gschema.xml.in:5
msgid "A list of processes which we don’t want killed"
msgstr "Une liste de processus que nous ne voulons pas tuer"

#: data/org.gnome.Usage.gschema.xml.in:6
msgid "This list is used for filtering which processes the user can’t stop."
msgstr ""
"Cette liste sert à filtrer les processus que l’utilisateur ne peut pas "
"arrêter."

#: data/ui/app-dialog.ui:78
msgid "Application is running with no visible window"
msgstr "L’application est en cours d’exécution sans fenêtre visible"

#: data/ui/app-dialog.ui:138
msgid "Quit App"
msgstr "Quitter l’application"

#: data/ui/app-dialog.ui:149
msgid "Force Quit"
msgstr "Forcer à quitter"

#: data/ui/memory-speedometer.ui:33
msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

